      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1964, four moshavot—Magdiel, Ramatayim, Kfar Hadar, and Ramat Hadar—merged to create Hod HaSharon.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
