      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hod_HaSharon",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Tel Qana, an archaeological site in Hod HaSharon, shows continuous settlement from the Bronze Age to Byzantine times.",
